rand via-brand/75 to-brand/20\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand via-transparent to-brand/55\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-gold\">Aktuelle Reise</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl font-serif text-5xl leading-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-8xl\">Essentielles Spanien</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-8 text-white/75 sm:text-lg\">Eine sechstägige Kulturreise ab Barcelona über Zaragoza, Madrid, Córdoba, Sevilla, Granada und Valencia.</p><div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><span class=\"border border-white/20 bg-brand/55 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-md\">6 Tage / 5 Nächte</span><span class=\"border border-gold/60 bg-brand/55 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-gold backdrop-blur-md\">Start jeden Sonntag in Barcelona</span></div><div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex min-h-13 items-center justify-center bg-gold px-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand transition hover:bg-bronze\" href=\"#request\">Diese Reise anfragen</a><a href=\"https://www.scribblemaps.com/maps/view/3/qcRyf3sTL4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-13 items-center justify-center border border-gold/70 bg-brand/55 px-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold backdrop-blur-md transition hover:bg-gold hover:text-brand\">Reiseroute ansehen</a></div></div></header><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-charcoal py-16 sm:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-gold\">Mit Vertrauen reisen</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl text-white sm:text-4xl\">Vier klare Leistungsversprechen</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-white/10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><article class=\"relative min-h-44 bg-brand p-7 sm:p-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] text-gold\">0<!-- -->1</span><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-lg font-semibold leading-7 text-white\">Lizenziertes deutsches Reiseunternehmen</h3><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 start-0 h-px w-16 bg-gold\"></div></article><article class=\"relative min-h-44 bg-brand p-7 sm:p-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] text-gold\">0<!-- -->2</span><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-lg font-semibold leading-7 text-white\">Vertrauenswürdiger syrischer Partner vor Ort</h3><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 start-0 h-px w-16 bg-gold\"></div></article><article class=\"relative min-h-44 bg-brand p-7 sm:p-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] text-gold\">0<!-- -->3</span><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-lg font-semibold leading-7 text-white\">Persönliche Betreuung rund um die Uhr</h3><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 start-0 h-px w-16 bg-gold\"></div></article><article class=\"relative min-h-44 bg-brand p-7 sm:p-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] text-gold\">0<!-- -->4</span><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-lg font-semibold leading-7 text-white\">Keine versteckten Kosten bei den Bodenleistungen</h3><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 start-0 h-px w-16 bg-gold\"></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-white/10 bg-charcoal py-16 sm:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-gold\">Reiseübersicht</p><p class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-2xl leading-relaxed text-white sm:text-3xl\">Eine ausgewogene Einführung in Spaniens kulturelle Kernregionen mit mediterranen Städten, historischen Landschaften und dem berühmten Erbe Andalusiens.</p></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-white/10 bg-brand py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-5\"